  "summary": "12 个节点、18 条连线组成的关系网：手写力导向布局自然铺开，拖动节点后松手会弹回布局，悬停时只高亮它和直接相邻的节点、连线，其余变淡。",
  "usage": "组织关系、依赖图、知识图谱的概览（8–14 个节点）；桌面端需要悬停和拖拽。",
  "caution": "节点超过 20 个会变成一团毛线，改用分组或邻接矩阵；移动端要把拖拽命中区放到 44px 以上。",
  "hint": "按住节点拖动，松手会弹回布局；悬停看直接关联",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【力导向关系图】目标：12 个节点的团队依赖 / 知识图谱概览；手写简化的力导向布局跑 200 帧成形，节点可拖拽，悬停高亮相邻节点和连线，稳定后停掉动画省电。\n\n1) 结构：.panel（卡片 340×156；弹窗 max-width 680px、height min(640px,100%)）> .head（标题 11/16px + 右侧 meta「12 节点 · 18 边」8.5/11.5px，弹窗里再加 40px 高的「重新排布」按钮）> .stage > svg（flex:1）。svg 内 `<g id=\"edges\">` 放 line，`<g id=\"nodes\">` 放 `<g class=\"node\">`（halo circle、dot circle、text 标签、透明 hit circle）。\n\n2) 力模拟（全部手写，不引库）：n=12 节点、18 条边。每帧：① 所有节点两两库仑斥力 f=k²/d（k=√(W·H/n)·0.95）；② 每条边弹簧力 f=d²/k·0.92；③ 中心引力 (center-pos)·0.013·k/56；④ 每帧位移按温度 cap 截断，温度每帧 ×0.965，初始 k×0.12，200 帧后温度 <0.3 就停掉 requestAnimationFrame。节点坐标 clamp 在 [dotR+4, W-dotR-4]。\n\n3) 尺寸：dotR=max(4.6, min(17, min(W,H)·0.055))（卡片约 7、弹窗 17）；hit 半径 max(dotR·2.4, 22)（弹窗命中区约 88px 直径）；卡片不显示标签，弹窗显示 12px 标签。\n\n4) 拖拽用 Pointer Events：pointerdown 从 data-id 取节点、记录指针偏移、node.fixed=true、停止模拟、svg.setPointerCapture；pointermove 每帧直接改坐标并重绘（不要用 CSS transition 追指针）；pointerup / pointercancel 解除 fixed，用低热度（temp=k×0.035、80 帧）重新 relax，让节点弹回布局。svg 上 touch-action:none、user-select:none。\n\n5) 悬停：pointermove 用 closest('.node') 找节点；被悬停节点 + 直接相邻节点 + 相连边保持不透明，其余 node opacity .26、edge opacity .18（过渡 .18s）；节点加一圈 brand 光晕、标签变 brand；标题右侧 meta 换成「核心平台 · 3 个直接关联」。\n\n6) 标签防重叠（弹窗）：每个标签按 右 / 左 / 上 / 下 四个候选位试位，用「字数×12.5」估宽做矩形碰撞检测（其它节点圆和已放标签都算障碍），取第一个不出界、不重叠的位置。\n\n7) 配色只用 --ui-*：面板 surface 混 4% text；节点 fill=color-mix(brand 88%/60%/36%, surface)；边=text 26%；高亮边=brand 72%；光晕=brand 52%。不写死 hex。\n\n8) 自动演示（只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时跑）：打散 → 200 帧成形（约 3.3 秒）→ 依次高亮两个节点 → 用 window.__uiDemoCursor() 拖一个节点（press → 0.78 秒缓动移动 → release → 回弹）→ 2.5 秒后重来。prefers-reduced-motion 下跳过演示，直接同步算完 200 帧静态显示。\n\n9) 无障碍：svg role=\"img\" + aria-label 说明节点/边数量；「重新排布」按钮带 aria-label；focus-visible 有描边。\n\n10) 坑：① 拖拽每帧直接写 transform，别让 CSS transition 追指针；② 首帧 getBoundingClientRect 可能为 0，要等布局完再算；③ 用 ResizeObserver 适配尺寸变化，但尺寸没变时不要重启模拟；④ 停 rAF 后悬停、拖拽仍要能触发重绘。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px;overflow:hidden}\n  .panel{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;max-width:340px;height:156px;padding:8px 10px 6px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);box-shadow:0 8px 22px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent);overflow:hidden}\n  .head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex:0 0 auto}\n  .h-left{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;min-width:0}\n  .title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px;white-space:nowrap}\n  .meta{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .meta.on{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .shuffle{display:none;flex:0 0 auto;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 18%,transparent);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer}\n  .shuffle:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,transparent)}\n  .shuffle:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-brand);outline-offset:2px}\n  .stage{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;margin-top:2px}\n  svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n  .edge{stroke:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 26%,transparent);stroke-width:1.1;transition:opacity .18s ease,stroke .18s ease}\n  .edge.hl{stroke:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 72%,var(--ui-surface));stroke-width:2.2}\n  .edge.dim{opacity:.18}\n  .node{cursor:grab;transition:opacity .18s ease}\n  .node:active{cursor:grabbing}\n  .node.dim{opacity:.26}\n  .node.hl{opacity:1}\n  .node .hit{fill:transparent}\n  .node .dot{stroke:var(--ui-surface);stroke-width:1.4}\n  .node .halo{fill:none;stroke:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 52%,transparent);stroke-width:1.4;opacity:0;transition:opacity .18s ease}\n  .node.hl .halo{opacity:1}\n  .node .lbl{display:none;font-size:12px;fill:var(--ui-text);paint-order:stroke;stroke:var(--ui-bg);stroke-width:3px;stroke-linejoin:round;pointer-events:none}\n  .node.hl .lbl{fill:var(--ui-brand)}\n  @media (min-height:421px){\n    body{padding:24px}\n    .panel{max-width:680px;height:min(640px,100%);padding:18px 22px 16px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 18px 48px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)}\n    .head{gap:14px}\n    .h-left{gap:10px;flex:1 1 auto}\n    .title{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.1px}\n    .meta{font-size:11.5px}\n    .shuffle{display:inline-flex}\n    .node .lbl{display:block}\n    .edge{stroke-width:1.6}\n    .edge.hl{stroke-width:2.8}\n    .node .dot{stroke-width:2.2}\n    .node .halo{stroke-width:2}\n  }\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:8px}\n    .panel{height:160px}\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .edge,.node,.node .halo{transition:none}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <div class=\"h-left\">\n      <span class=\"title\">团队依赖关系</span>\n      <span class=\"meta\" id=\"meta\">12 节点 · 18 边</span>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"shuffle\" id=\"shuffle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"重新随机排布节点\">重新排布</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stage\">\n    <svg id=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"团队依赖关系图：12 个节点、18 条连线，可拖动节点，悬停高亮相邻节点\">\n      <g id=\"edges\"></g>\n      <g id=\"nodes\"></g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\n  var svg=document.getElementById('graph'),\n      gEdges=document.getElementById('edges'),\n      gNodes=document.getElementById('nodes'),\n      metaEl=document.getElementById('meta'),\n      panel=document.getElementById('panel'),\n      shuffle=document.getElementById('shuffle');\n\n  var DATA=[\n    {label:'核心平台',g:0},\n    {label:'网关',g:0},\n    {label:'账号服务',g:1},\n    {label:'订单服务',g:1},\n    {label:'支付服务',g:1},\n    {label:'消息队列',g:2},\n    {label:'缓存',g:2},\n    {label:'搜索',g:1},\n    {label:'推荐',g:2},\n    {label:'数据仓库',g:2},\n    {label:'报表',g:2},\n    {label:'风控',g:1}\n  ];\n  var LINKS=[\n    [0,1],[0,2],[0,5],[1,3],[1,4],[1,11],[2,6],[2,7],\n    [3,4],[3,9],[4,11],[5,8],[5,9],[6,7],[7,8],[8,10],[9,10],[10,11]\n  ];\n  var SHADE={0:'88%',1:'60%',2:'36%'};\n\n  var nodes=DATA.map(function(d,i){\n    return {id:i,label:d.label,g:d.g,x:0,y:0,fixed:false,el:null,dot:null,halo:null,lbl:null,hit:null};\n  });\n  var links=LINKS.map(function(p){\n    return {a:p[0],b:p[1],el:null};\n  });\n  var adj=nodes.map(function(){return [];});\n  links.forEach(function(l){ adj[l.a].push(l.b); adj[l.b].push(l.a); });\n\n  links.forEach(function(l){\n    var el=document.createElementNS(NS,'line');\n    el.setAttribute('class','edge');\n    gEdges.appendChild(el);\n    l.el=el;\n  });\n  nodes.forEach(function(n){\n    var g=document.createElementNS(NS,'g');\n    g.setAttribute('class','node');\n    g.setAttribute('data-id',n.id);\n    var halo=document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    halo.setAttribute('class','halo');\n    var dot=document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    dot.setAttribute('class','dot');\n    dot.style.fill='color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) '+SHADE[n.g]+', var(--ui-surface))';\n    var txt=document.createElementNS(NS,'text');\n    txt.setAttribute('class','lbl');\n    txt.textContent=n.label;\n    var hit=document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    hit.setAttribute('class','hit');\n    g.appendChild(halo); g.appendChild(dot); g.appendChild(txt); g.appendChild(hit);\n    gNodes.appendChild(g);\n    n.el=g; n.dot=dot; n.halo=halo; n.lbl=txt; n.hit=hit;\n  });\n\n  function mulberry32(a){\n    return function(){\n      a|=0; a=a+0x6D2B79F5|0;\n      var t=Math.imul(a^a>>>15,1|a);\n      t=t+Math.imul(t^t>>>7,61|t)^t;\n      return ((t^t>>>14)>>>0)/4294967296;\n    };\n  }\n  var rnd=mulberry32(0x9E3779B9);\n  var REDUCED=false;\n  try{ REDUCED=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches; }catch(e){}\n\n  var W=0,H=0,dotR=7,kLen=56,temp=0,pending=0,rafId=0,demoRaf=0,hover=-1,drag=null;\n  var timers=[];\n  var INTERACTIVE=!!window.__uiInteractive;\n\n  function after(ms,fn){ var t=setTimeout(fn,ms); timers.push(t); return t; }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i=0;i<timers.length;i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers=[]; }\n\n  function measure(){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width||!r.height) return false;\n    W=Math.round(r.width); H=Math.round(r.height);\n    svg.setAttribute('viewBox','0 0 '+W+' '+H);\n    kLen=Math.sqrt(W*H/nodes.length)*0.95;\n    dotR=Math.max(4.6,Math.min(17,Math.min(W,H)*0.055));\n    nodes.forEach(function(n){\n      n.dot.setAttribute('r',dotR);\n      n.halo.setAttribute('r',dotR+3.6);\n      n.hit.setAttribute('r',Math.max(dotR*2.4,22));\n      n.lbl.setAttribute('x',dotR+5);\n      n.lbl.setAttribute('y',dotR*0.35);\n    });\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  function clampNode(n){\n    var pad=dotR+4;\n    n.x=Math.max(pad,Math.min(W-pad,n.x));\n    n.y=Math.max(pad,Math.min(H-pad,n.y));\n  }\n\n  function scatter(){\n    var cx=W/2, cy=H/2;\n    nodes.forEach(function(n,i){\n      var a=(i/nodes.length)*Math.PI*2+rnd()*0.6;\n      var rad=Math.min(W,H)*(0.16+rnd()*0.26);\n      n.x=cx+Math.cos(a)*rad*1.35;\n      n.y=cy+Math.sin(a)*rad;\n      n.fixed=false;\n      clampNode(n);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function step(){\n    var n=nodes.length,i,j,dx,dy,d,f,ux,uy;\n    var disp=[];\n    for(i=0;i<n;i++) disp.push({x:0,y:0});\n    for(i=0;i<n;i++){\n      for(j=i+1;j<n;j++){\n        dx=nodes[j].x-nodes[i].x;\n        dy=nodes[j].y-nodes[i].y;\n        d=Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy);\n        if(d<0.01){ d=0.01; dx=0.01; dy=0; }\n        f=kLen*kLen/d;\n        ux=dx/d; uy=dy/d;\n        disp[i].x-=ux*f; disp[i].y-=uy*f;\n        disp[j].x+=ux*f; disp[j].y+=uy*f;\n      }\n    }\n    for(i=0;i<links.length;i++){\n      var l=links[i], a=nodes[l.a], b=nodes[l.b];\n      dx=b.x-a.x; dy=b.y-a.y;\n      d=Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy)||0.01;\n      f=(d*d/kLen)*0.92;\n      ux=dx/d; uy=dy/d;\n      disp[l.a].x+=ux*f; disp[l.a].y+=uy*f;\n      disp[l.b].x-=ux*f; disp[l.b].y-=uy*f;\n    }\n    var cx=W/2, cy=H/2, grav=0.013*kLen/56;\n    for(i=0;i<n;i++){\n      var nd=nodes[i];\n      disp[i].x+=(cx-nd.x)*grav;\n      disp[i].y+=(cy-nd.y)*grav;\n      if(nd.fixed) continue;\n      var m=Math.sqrt(disp[i].x*disp[i].x+disp[i].y*disp[i].y)||0.001;\n      var cap=Math.min(m,temp);\n      nd.x+=disp[i].x/m*cap;\n      nd.y+=disp[i].y/m*cap;\n      clampNode(nd);\n    }\n    temp*=0.965;\n  }\n\n  function draw(){\n    var i;\n    for(i=0;i<links.length;i++){\n      var l=links[i], a=nodes[l.a], b=nodes[l.b];\n      l.el.setAttribute('x1',a.x.toFixed(3));\n      l.el.setAttribute('y1',a.y.toFixed(3));\n      l.el.setAttribute('x2',b.x.toFixed(3));\n      l.el.setAttribute('y2',b.y.toFixed(3));\n    }\n    for(i=0;i<nodes.length;i++){\n      var nd=nodes[i];\n      nd.el.setAttribute('transform','translate('+nd.x.toFixed(3)+' '+nd.y.toFixed(3)+')');\n    }\n    /* 标签防重叠：右 / 左 / 上 / 下 四个候选位，挑第一个不压节点、不出界的 */\n    var boxes=[];\n    for(i=0;i<nodes.length;i++){\n      boxes.push({x0:nodes[i].x-dotR-2,x1:nodes[i].x+dotR+2,y0:nodes[i].y-dotR-2,y1:nodes[i].y+dotR+2});\n    }\n    var fs=dotR>10?12.5:7;\n    var sorted=nodes.slice().sort(function(a,b){ return a.y-b.y; });\n    for(i=0;i<sorted.length;i++){\n      var n=sorted[i];\n      var est=n.label.length*fs;\n      var cands=[\n        {dx:dotR+6,dy:dotR*0.35,anchor:'start'},\n        {dx:-(dotR+6),dy:dotR*0.35,anchor:'end'},\n        {dx:0,dy:-(dotR+6),anchor:'middle'},\n        {dx:0,dy:dotR+14,anchor:'middle'}\n      ];\n      var pick=null;\n      for(var c=0;c<cands.length;c++){\n        var cd=cands[c];\n        var gx=n.x+cd.dx, gy=n.y+cd.dy;\n        var x0=cd.anchor==='middle'?gx-est/2:(cd.anchor==='end'?gx-est:gx);\n        var x1=x0+est, y0=gy-11, y1=gy+4;\n        if(x0<2||x1>W-2||y0<2||y1>H-2) continue;\n        var hit=false;\n        for(var b=0;b<boxes.length;b++){\n          var o=boxes[b];\n          if(x0<o.x1&&x1>o.x0&&y0<o.y1&&y1>o.y0){ hit=true; break; }\n        }\n        if(hit) continue;\n        pick={dx:cd.dx,dy:cd.dy,anchor:cd.anchor,x0:x0,x1:x1,y0:y0,y1:y1};\n        break;\n      }\n      if(!pick){\n        pick={dx:dotR+6,dy:dotR*0.35,anchor:'start',x0:n.x+dotR+6,x1:n.x+dotR+6+est,y0:n.y-11,y1:n.y+4};\n      }\n      boxes.push(pick);\n      n.lbl.setAttribute('x',pick.dx.toFixed(2));\n      n.lbl.setAttribute('y',pick.dy.toFixed(2));\n      n.lbl.setAttribute('text-anchor',pick.anchor);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function simulate(steps){\n    temp=Math.max(1.2,kLen*0.12);\n    for(var s=0;s<steps;s++) step();\n    temp=0;\n  }\n\n  function startSim(frames,heat){\n    if(REDUCED){ simulate(frames); draw(); return; }\n    pending=frames;\n    temp=Math.max(1.2,kLen*(heat===undefined?0.12:heat));\n    if(rafId) cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);\n    rafId=0;\n    var tick=function(){\n      rafId=0;\n      if(pending<=0 || temp<0.3){ temp=0; return; }\n      step(); draw();\n      pending--;\n      if(pending>0 && temp>=0.3) rafId=requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n      else temp=0;\n    };\n    rafId=requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n\n  function stopSim(){\n    if(rafId) cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);\n    rafId=0; pending=0; temp=0;\n  }\n\n  function setHover(i){\n    if(i===hover) return;\n    hover=i;\n    var on=i>=0;\n    var near={};\n    if(on){\n      near[i]=1;\n      for(var k=0;k<adj[i].length;k++) near[adj[i][k]]=1;\n    }\n    nodes.forEach(function(n,idx){\n      var hot=on&&near[idx];\n      n.el.classList.toggle('hl',!!hot);\n      n.el.classList.toggle('dim',on&&!hot);\n    });\n    links.forEach(function(l){\n      var hot=on&&(l.a===i||l.b===i);\n      l.el.classList.toggle('hl',!!hot);\n      l.el.classList.toggle('dim',on&&!hot);\n    });\n    if(on){\n      metaEl.textContent=nodes[i].label+' · '+adj[i].length+' 个直接关联';\n      metaEl.classList.add('on');\n    }else{\n      metaEl.textContent=nodes.length+' 节点 · '+links.length+' 边';\n      metaEl.classList.remove('on');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function localPoint(e){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    return {x:(e.clientX-r.left)*(W/r.width), y:(e.clientY-r.top)*(H/r.height)};\n  }\n\n  function endDrag(){\n    if(!drag) return;\n    var n=nodes[drag.id];\n    n.fixed=false;\n    drag=null;\n    svg.classList.remove('dragging');\n    startSim(80,0.035);\n  }\n\n  if(INTERACTIVE){\n    svg.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){\n      var g=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.node'):null;\n      if(!g) return;\n      var id=+g.getAttribute('data-id');\n      var p=localPoint(e);\n      drag={id:id,dx:nodes[id].x-p.x,dy:nodes[id].y-p.y};\n      nodes[id].fixed=true;\n      stopSim();\n      setHover(id);\n      try{ svg.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); }catch(err){}\n      e.preventDefault();\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('pointermove',function(e){\n      if(drag){\n        var p=localPoint(e);\n        var n=nodes[drag.id];\n        n.x=p.x+drag.dx;\n        n.y=p.y+drag.dy;\n        clampNode(n);\n        draw();\n        return;\n      }\n      var g=e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.node'):null;\n      setHover(g?+g.getAttribute('data-id'):-1);\n    });\n    svg.addEventListener('pointerup',endDrag);\n    svg.addEventListener('pointercancel',endDrag);\n    svg.addEventListener('pointerleave',function(){ if(!drag) setHover(-1); });\n    shuffle.addEventListener('click',function(){\n      stopSim();\n      scatter();\n      draw();\n      setHover(-1);\n      startSim(200);\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 自动演示：布局成型 → 高亮相邻 → 拖一个节点 ---------- */\n  function dragDemo(){\n    if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n    var id=4,n=nodes[id];\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var cursor=window.__uiDemoCursor?window.__uiDemoCursor():null;\n    stopSim();\n    if(!cursor){ after(1400,runDemo); return; }\n    cursor.at(r.left+n.x,r.top+n.y);\n    after(650,function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      n.fixed=true;\n      setHover(id);\n      var from={x:n.x,y:n.y};\n      var to={x:n.x+W*0.22,y:n.y-H*0.18};\n      to.x=Math.max(dotR+6,Math.min(W-dotR-6,to.x));\n      to.y=Math.max(dotR+6,Math.min(H-dotR-6,to.y));\n      var t0=performance.now(),dur=780;\n      var move=function(ts){\n        if(INTERACTIVE) return;\n        var t=Math.min(1,(ts-t0)/dur);\n        var e=1-Math.pow(1-t,3);\n        n.x=from.x+(to.x-from.x)*e;\n        n.y=from.y+(to.y-from.y)*e;\n        draw();\n        cursor.at(r.left+n.x,r.top+n.y);\n        if(t<1){ demoRaf=requestAnimationFrame(move); }\n        else{\n          cursor.release();\n          n.fixed=false;\n          startSim(70,0.05);\n          after(1100,function(){ setHover(-1); cursor.hide(); });\n          after(2500,runDemo);\n        }\n      };\n      demoRaf=requestAnimationFrame(move);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function runDemo(){\n    if(INTERACTIVE||REDUCED) return;\n    clearTimers();\n    setHover(-1);\n    scatter();\n    draw();\n    startSim(200);\n    after(3900,function(){ if(!INTERACTIVE) setHover(0); });\n    after(5100,function(){ if(!INTERACTIVE) setHover(7); });\n    after(6300,function(){ if(!INTERACTIVE){ setHover(-1); dragDemo(); } });\n  }\n\n  var resizeTimer=0;\n  function onResize(){\n    clearTimeout(resizeTimer);\n    resizeTimer=setTimeout(function(){\n      var oldW=W, oldH=H;\n      if(!measure()) return;\n      if(W===oldW && H===oldH) return;\n      scatter();\n      draw();\n      if(INTERACTIVE){ startSim(160); }\n      else{ runDemo(); }\n    },180);\n  }\n\n  function boot(){\n    if(!measure()){ after(200,boot); return; }\n    scatter();\n    draw();\n    if(INTERACTIVE){\n      startSim(200);\n    }else{\n      runDemo();\n    }\n  }\n\n  if(window.ResizeObserver){\n    try{ new ResizeObserver(onResize).observe(panel); }catch(e){ window.addEventListener('resize',onResize); }\n  }else{\n    window.addEventListener('resize',onResize);\n  }\n\n  boot();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
